<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street opened marginally higher on Monday after Friday's sharp fall but soon lost ground again.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average was down 11.63 points or 0.18 percent at 6,380.06 by 1340 GMT. The 30-year long bond was unchanged to yield 7.17 percent.</p>
